[{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Each of the following are an eigenvalue with its corresponding eigenvector for a matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf M\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>In each case, describe the effect of the transformation in the direction of the given eigenvector:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=2,\\mathbf v=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=4,\\mathbf v=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=1,\\mathbf v=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-1,\\mathbf v=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-2,\\mathbf v=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor 2</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are stretched by scale factor 4</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant; This is a line of invariant points.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant but points are reflected across the origin along the line.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">e)</h3><p>Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are stretched by scale factor 2 and points are reflected across the origin along the line.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>A transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues of matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and their corresponding eigenvectors.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and give a geometrical interpretation of this value.</p></li><li><p>Describe fully the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}-\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}2-\\lambda&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(2-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(1-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)(3-\\lambda)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=1,\\lambda_2=2\\text{ or }\\lambda_3=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-1\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow x+y=0\\quad(1)\\\\2y=0\\quad(2)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> But since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0,x=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_1=1,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow y=0\\quad(1)\\\\-z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0,z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_2=2,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-3\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow -x+y=0\\quad(1)\\\\-2z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=x,z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_3=3,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore \\text{when }\\lambda_1=1,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_2=2,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_3=3,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det\\mathbf A=\\begin{vmatrix}2&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;3&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{vmatrix}=2\\times3\\times1=6\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The transformation scales the volume by a factor of 6</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The eigenvalues and eigenvectors tell us:</p>","<ul class=\"parts\"><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor 2</p></li><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor 3</p></li><li><p>The <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis is invariant; This is a line of invariant points.</p></li></ul>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>A transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues of matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and their corresponding eigenvectors.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and give a geometrical interpretation of this value.</p></li><li><p>Describe fully the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-1&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}-\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-1-\\lambda&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1-\\lambda&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(-1-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-1-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda)(2-\\lambda)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=-1,\\lambda_2=1\\text{ or }\\lambda_3=2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A+1\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow 2y-z=0\\quad(1)\\\\2y+z=0\\quad(2)\\\\3z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0\\Rightarrow y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_1=1,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-1\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-2&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow -2x+2y-z=0\\quad(1)\\\\z=0\\quad(2)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x=y,z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_2=1,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-2\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-3&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow -3x+2y-z=0\\quad(1)\\\\-y+z=0\\quad(2)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=y\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Sub into (1): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-3x+y=0\\therefore y=3x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_3=2,\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore \\text{when }\\lambda_1=-1,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_2=1,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_3=2,\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det\\mathbf A=\\begin{vmatrix}-1&amp;2&amp;-1\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\\\0&amp;0&amp;2\\end{vmatrix}=-1\\times1\\times2=-2\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The transformation scales the volume by a factor of 2 and orientation is reversed.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The eigenvalues and eigenvectors tell us:</p>","<ul class=\"parts\"><li><p>Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are reflected across the origin along the axis.</p></li><li><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant; This is a line of invariant points.</p></li><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\3\\\\3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor 2</p></li></ul>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>A transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues of matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and their corresponding eigenvectors.</p></li><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\det\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and give a geometrical interpretation of this value.</p></li><li><p>Describe fully the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}3&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}-\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}3-\\lambda&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-1-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(3-\\lambda)(-1-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3-\\lambda)(-1-\\lambda)(1-\\lambda)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=-1,\\lambda_2=1\\text{ or }\\lambda_3=3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A+1\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}4&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow 4x-4y-2z=0\\quad(1)\\\\2y+2z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-z\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Sub into (1): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"4x+2z=0\\Rightarrow z=-2x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_1=-1,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-1\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow 2x-4y-2z=0\\quad(1)\\\\-2y=0\\quad(2)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0,x=z\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_2=1,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-3\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-4&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;-2\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow -4y-2z=0\\quad(1)\\\\-4y=0\\quad(2)\\\\2y-2z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=y\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_3=3,\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore \\text{when }\\lambda_1=-1,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_2=1,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_3=3,\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det\\mathbf A=\\begin{vmatrix}3&amp;-4&amp;-2\\\\0&amp;-1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;1\\end{vmatrix}=3\\times-1\\times1=-3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>The transformation scales the volume by a factor of 3 and orientation is reversed.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The eigenvalues and eigenvectors tell us:</p>","<ul class=\"parts\"><li><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\2\\\\-2\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant but points are reflected across the origin along the line.</p></li><li><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant; This is a line of invariant points.</p></li><li><p>Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are stretched by scale factor 3</p></li></ul>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Under a linear transformation, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(3,4,-1)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is mapped to the point <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-15,-20,5)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>For the matrix representing <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write down the eigenvector.</p></li><li><p>Write down the corresponding eigenvalue.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><p>Since <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"-5\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\4\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}-15\\\\-20\\\\5\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}3\\\\4\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is an eigenvector.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda=-5\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>A transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span>. Under the transformation, points on the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor 2. Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are invariant. Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are stretched by scale factor 3 and reflected across the origin.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Describe fully the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answers in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Determine the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Determine the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><ul class=\"parts\"><li><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>The <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"x\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis is invariant; points on this line remain unchanged.</p></li><li><p>Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(-3)^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> (<span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with a reflection if <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is odd)</p></li></ul>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf P=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix},\\mathbf D=\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\mathbf P^{-1}=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-3&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-5&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-5&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;-3\\end{pmatrix}^n\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}2^n&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;(-3)^n\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\-1&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}0&amp;2^n&amp;0\\\\1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;(-3)^n&amp;(-3)^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\mathbf A^n=\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;2^n&amp;0\\\\0&amp;-2^n+(-3)^n&amp;(-3)^n\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>A transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is represented by the matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;p&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for non-zero constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p,q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p&lt;q&lt;r\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues and corresponding eigenvectors of matrix <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answer in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p,q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Show that the three invariant lines are mutually perpendicular.</p></li><li><p>Describe fully the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;p&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}p&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;p&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r\\end{pmatrix}-\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}=\\begin{pmatrix}p-\\lambda&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;p-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=(p-\\lambda)(p-\\lambda)(r-\\lambda)-q(q)(r-\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(r-\\lambda)((p-\\lambda)(p-\\lambda)-q(q))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(r-\\lambda)(p^2-2p\\lambda+\\lambda^2-q^2)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(r-\\lambda)(\\lambda-(p+q))(\\lambda-(p-q))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>So <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(r-\\lambda)(\\lambda-(p+q))(\\lambda-(p-q))=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=p-q,\\lambda_2=p+q\\text{ or }\\lambda_3=r\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1=p-q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-(p-q)\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}q&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;q&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r-p+q\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}q&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;q&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r-p+q\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow qx+qy=0\\quad(1)\\\\(r-p+q)z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=-x\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_1=p-q,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_2=p+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-(p+q)\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}-q&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;-q&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r-p-q\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}-q&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;-q&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;r-p-q\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow -qx+qy=0\\quad(1)\\\\qx-qy=0\\quad(2)\\\\(r-p-q)z=0\\quad(3)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\therefore\" data-display=\"false\"></span> <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z=0,y=x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_2=p+q,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>When <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_3=r\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-(r)\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}p-r&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;p-r&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}p-r&amp;q&amp;0\\\\q&amp;p-r&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;0\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=0\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{gathered}\\Rightarrow (p-r)x+qy=0\\quad(1)\\\\qx+(p-r)y=0\\quad(2)\\end{gathered}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>From (2): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"y=\\frac{q}{r-p}x\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>Sub into (1): <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(p-r)x+q\\left(\\frac{q}{r-p}x\\right)=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<p>so for distinct eigenvalues <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(r\\neq p\\pm q),x=y=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\text{ when }\\lambda_3=r,\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore \\text{when }\\lambda_1=p-q,\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_2=p+q,\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix},\\quad\\text{when }\\lambda_3=r,\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}=1-1+0=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are perpendicular.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=0-0+0=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are perpendicular.</p>","<p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\\cdot\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}=0+0+0=0\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are perpendicular.</p>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><p>The eigenvalues and eigenvectors tell us:</p>","<ul class=\"parts\"><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\-1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p-q\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\0\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"p+q\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Points along the <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z\" data-display=\"false\"></span>-axis are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"r\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ul>"]},{"id":"fm-core2-2.74-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>A transformation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"T\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is represented by the matrix</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A=\\begin{pmatrix}1-k&amp;k&amp;k\\\\-2&amp;k+1&amp;2\\\\2-2k&amp;k&amp;2k-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span><p>where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is a constant where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k&gt;2\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><p>The eigenvalues of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\lambda_1&lt;\\lambda_2&lt;\\lambda_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find the eigenvalues of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol><p>The eigenvectors of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are given by</p><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf v_1=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix},\\mathbf v_2=\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\\text{ and }\\mathbf v_3=\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"2\"><li><p>Describe fully the transformation represented by <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> giving your answers in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1-k&amp;k&amp;k\\\\-2&amp;k+1&amp;2\\\\2-2k&amp;k&amp;2k-1\\end{pmatrix}\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}=\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}x\\\\y\\\\z\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I=\\begin{pmatrix}1-k&amp;k&amp;k\\\\-2&amp;k+1&amp;2\\\\2-2k&amp;k&amp;2k-1\\end{pmatrix}-\\lambda\\begin{pmatrix}1&amp;0&amp;0\\\\0&amp;1&amp;0\\\\0&amp;0&amp;1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\begin{pmatrix}1-k-\\lambda&amp;k&amp;k\\\\-2&amp;k+1-\\lambda&amp;2\\\\2-2k&amp;k&amp;2k-1-\\lambda\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\det(\\mathbf A-\\lambda\\mathbf I)=\\begin{vmatrix}1-k-\\lambda&amp;k&amp;k\\\\-2&amp;k+1-\\lambda&amp;2\\\\2-2k&amp;k&amp;2k-1-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\begin{vmatrix}1-k-\\lambda&amp;k&amp;k\\\\-2&amp;k+1-\\lambda&amp;2\\\\1-k+\\lambda&amp;0&amp;k-1-\\lambda\\end{vmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=\\begin{vmatrix}1-k-\\lambda&amp;k&amp;1-\\lambda\\\\-2&amp;k+1-\\lambda&amp;0\\\\1-k+\\lambda&amp;0&amp;0\\end{vmatrix}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=0-0+(1-\\lambda)(-(k+1-\\lambda)(1-k+\\lambda))\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\n=(1-\\lambda)(k+1-\\lambda)(k-1-\\lambda)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\therefore\\lambda_1=1,\\lambda_2=k-1\\text{ or }\\lambda_3=k+1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>The eigenvalues and eigenvectors tell us:</p>","<ul class=\"parts\"><li><p>The line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\0\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is invariant; This is a line of invariant points.</p></li><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}0\\\\1\\\\-1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k-1)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p>Points along the line with direction <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\begin{pmatrix}1\\\\1\\\\1\\end{pmatrix}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are stretched by scale factor <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"(k+1)^3\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ul>"]}]